{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"AISkills402","version":"1.0.0","summary":"Tested AI agent skill files (SKILL.md), bought once over x402.","description":"What is sold is the SKILL.md file itself, as a one-time purchase in USDC on Base: you keep it forever, re-download it free and get new versions free. No account, no API key.","x-guidance":"Buy a skill file: GET /v1/skills lists skills with prices and buy_url. GET the buy_url with no payment header: the answer is 402 with a PAYMENT-REQUIRED header (base64 JSON, x402 v2). Sign accepts[0] with an x402 client (for example x402HTTPClient from @x402/core/http plus @x402/evm) and repeat the SAME GET with the PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header. The 200 answer is JSON: file.content (the SKILL.md text), sha256, receipt and redownload.token. The token is shown ONCE: store it; GET /v1/purchases/{token} re-downloads for free, including new versions. Every single-skill price is under the default $1 per-payment cap of @x402/core clients. Packs: choose any 10 to 200 skills and pay once with a discount (10+ skills: 20% off, 30+ skills: 30% off). GET https://api.aiskills402.com/v1/packs/file?skills=slug-a,slug-b,... with no payment header: the answer is a 402 with the pack price (the sum of the skill prices minus the discount, rounded down). Pay it exactly like a single skill. The 200 answer lists every skill with its file and its OWN redownload token. A pack above $1.00 needs the client cap raised (spendControls.maxAmountPerPayment) or two packs of at least 10. Skills you already own are charged again in this release. If a 402 body or /health says selling:false, the till is closed: do not sign. Refusals carry a snake_case `error` code: branch on the code, never on the prose."},"servers":[{"url":"https://api.aiskills402.com"}],"externalDocs":{"description":"Documentation","url":"https://aiskills402.com/docs"},"x-discovery":{"ownershipProofs":["0x8e37022edcf0f21cf3c9f93fee9d4d32519f36f4"]},"tags":[{"name":"payment","description":"Buying a skill file with x402"},{"name":"public","description":"Open endpoints, no payment and no key"}],"paths":{"/v1/skills/cloudflare-evidence-check/file":{"get":{"operationId":"buy_cloudflare_evidence_check","summary":"Buy the Cloudflare Evidence Check skill file (SKILL.md)","description":"Judges whether a check someone ran on a Cloudflare-hosted site really proves what they claim, and answers as JSON with a verdict, the reason and the one check that would decide. Knows the instruments that answer for the wrong thing - the command-line object read that serves a cached copy after a delete, a delivery log that records neither test mail, a zero-row log search that looks the same as code that never ran, a local migration run, a staging secret, the free preview subdomain of a Worker that is not a zone, a size counter that prints zero on Windows, a character count that counts bytes, a robots file served from the edge cache - and the checks that do prove it. Use when an agent says deleted, delivered, applied, enabled, set on production or never ran on Cloudflare work, and you need to know whether its evidence supports that. One-time purchase of the SKILL.md file: you pay once, keep it forever, and re-download it and get new versions free with the token from the 200 answer.","tags":["payment"],"security":[],"parameters":[{"name":"x402Version","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Force the older protocol version. Only for clients that speak x402 v1.","schema":{"type":"integer","enum":[1,2],"default":2}}],"x-payment-info":{"protocols":[{"x402":{}}],"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.07"},"network":"base","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0x8e37022edcf0f21cf3c9f93fee9d4d32519f36f4"},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Payment settled. JSON with file.content (the SKILL.md text), sha256, receipt and redownload.token (shown once)."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The requirements travel in the PAYMENT-REQUIRED header (base64 JSON, x402 v2) and in the body. Nothing is charged by a 402. Also returned when the till is closed (selling: false): then do not sign."},"404":{"description":"skill_not_found: no such skill, or it is not sold as a file."},"409":{"description":"payment_in_progress: the same payment is being processed. Retry the identical header; nothing was charged twice. already_paid: this authorization was already settled - do NOT sign a new one. A replayed header returns the file only within 60 s of purchase and only when signed by the paying wallet; otherwise the reply carries the receipt, not the file. Use the redownload token from your first response."},"429":{"description":"rate_limited: wait retry_after_seconds. The per-wallet limit counts only fresh authorizations whose signature recovers to that wallet; a header carrying your address with someone else's signature, or a replay of an already-settled authorization, does not count against you. reason lane_hourly_ceiling: our own hourly ceiling on fresh attempts toward the payment facilitator (per signature lane, not per wallet) is reached; the reply carries lane and Retry-After, the number of seconds until the top of the next UTC hour. Nothing was charged and the nonce is not spent - resend the identical header after that, re-sign only if it has expired."},"500":{"description":"Branch on `error` and `retryable`. file_missing / file_corrupt (retryable: true): the payment is recorded; resend the identical payment header later and you get the file without a second charge. payment_accepted_not_delivered (retryable: false): do NOT sign a new authorization; quote the nonce from the body, we reconcile by hand."},"503":{"description":"not_selling, facilitator_unavailable or temporarily_unavailable: nothing was settled; retry later."}}}},"/v1/skills/shorten-to-limit/file":{"get":{"operationId":"buy_shorten_to_limit","summary":"Buy the Shorten to a Limit skill file (SKILL.md)","description":"Cuts a text down to a stated limit (words or characters) by editing the author's own text, keeping every number, name, date, address and qualifier of every fact that stays, and counting the result so it is under the limit. Use when a text must fit a field with a maximum length, such as a social post, a notification, a slide line, an abstract, a form box or a short description, or when asked to cut, trim or shorten a text to N words or N characters. One-time purchase of the SKILL.md file: you pay once, keep it forever, and re-download it and get new versions free with the token from the 200 answer.","tags":["payment"],"security":[],"parameters":[{"name":"x402Version","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Force the older protocol version. Only for clients that speak x402 v1.","schema":{"type":"integer","enum":[1,2],"default":2}}],"x-payment-info":{"protocols":[{"x402":{}}],"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.05"},"network":"base","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0x8e37022edcf0f21cf3c9f93fee9d4d32519f36f4"},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Payment settled. JSON with file.content (the SKILL.md text), sha256, receipt and redownload.token (shown once)."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The requirements travel in the PAYMENT-REQUIRED header (base64 JSON, x402 v2) and in the body. Nothing is charged by a 402. Also returned when the till is closed (selling: false): then do not sign."},"404":{"description":"skill_not_found: no such skill, or it is not sold as a file."},"409":{"description":"payment_in_progress: the same payment is being processed. Retry the identical header; nothing was charged twice. already_paid: this authorization was already settled - do NOT sign a new one. A replayed header returns the file only within 60 s of purchase and only when signed by the paying wallet; otherwise the reply carries the receipt, not the file. Use the redownload token from your first response."},"429":{"description":"rate_limited: wait retry_after_seconds. The per-wallet limit counts only fresh authorizations whose signature recovers to that wallet; a header carrying your address with someone else's signature, or a replay of an already-settled authorization, does not count against you. reason lane_hourly_ceiling: our own hourly ceiling on fresh attempts toward the payment facilitator (per signature lane, not per wallet) is reached; the reply carries lane and Retry-After, the number of seconds until the top of the next UTC hour. Nothing was charged and the nonce is not spent - resend the identical header after that, re-sign only if it has expired."},"500":{"description":"Branch on `error` and `retryable`. file_missing / file_corrupt (retryable: true): the payment is recorded; resend the identical payment header later and you get the file without a second charge. payment_accepted_not_delivered (retryable: false): do NOT sign a new authorization; quote the nonce from the body, we reconcile by hand."},"503":{"description":"not_selling, facilitator_unavailable or temporarily_unavailable: nothing was settled; retry later."}}}},"/v1/skills/product-description/file":{"get":{"operationId":"buy_product_description","summary":"Buy the Product Description From a Spec Sheet skill file (SKILL.md)","description":"Writes shop product copy (title, short description, bullets, long description) from a specification sheet and nothing else, in the sheet's language. Every figure keeps its unit and its qualifier, no superlatives or unsupported claims, and values that contradict each other are reported instead of chosen. Use when asked to write a product description, product page text, catalogue entry or marketplace listing copy from a spec sheet, in any language. One-time purchase of the SKILL.md file: you pay once, keep it forever, and re-download it and get new versions free with the token from the 200 answer.","tags":["payment"],"security":[],"parameters":[{"name":"x402Version","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Force the older protocol version. Only for clients that speak x402 v1.","schema":{"type":"integer","enum":[1,2],"default":2}}],"x-payment-info":{"protocols":[{"x402":{}}],"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.05"},"network":"base","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0x8e37022edcf0f21cf3c9f93fee9d4d32519f36f4"},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Payment settled. JSON with file.content (the SKILL.md text), sha256, receipt and redownload.token (shown once)."},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The requirements travel in the PAYMENT-REQUIRED header (base64 JSON, x402 v2) and in the body. Nothing is charged by a 402. Also returned when the till is closed (selling: false): then do not sign."},"404":{"description":"skill_not_found: no such skill, or it is not sold as a file."},"409":{"description":"payment_in_progress: the same payment is being processed. Retry the identical header; nothing was charged twice. already_paid: this authorization was already settled - do NOT sign a new one. A replayed header returns the file only within 60 s of purchase and only when signed by the paying wallet; otherwise the reply carries the receipt, not the file. Use the redownload token from your first response."},"429":{"description":"rate_limited: wait retry_after_seconds. The per-wallet limit counts only fresh authorizations whose signature recovers to that wallet; a header carrying your address with someone else's signature, or a replay of an already-settled authorization, does not count against you. reason lane_hourly_ceiling: our own hourly ceiling on fresh attempts toward the payment facilitator (per signature lane, not per wallet) is reached; the reply carries lane and Retry-After, the number of seconds until the top of the next UTC hour. Nothing was charged and the nonce is not spent - resend the identical header after that, re-sign only if it has expired."},"500":{"description":"Branch on `error` and `retryable`. file_missing / file_corrupt (retryable: true): the payment is recorded; resend the identical payment header later and you get the file without a second charge. payment_accepted_not_delivered (retryable: false): do NOT sign a new authorization; quote the nonce from the body, we reconcile by hand."},"503":{"description":"not_selling, facilitator_unavailable or temporarily_unavailable: nothing was settled; retry later."}}}},"/v1/skills/job-description-from-notes/file":{"get":{"operationId":"buy_job_description_from_notes","summary":"Buy the Job Description From Notes: Gaps Marked, Nothing Invented skill file (SKILL.md)","description":"Turns a hiring manager's rough notes into a job post with fixed sections (title, about the role, responsibilities, requirements, nice to have, location and working model, pay, process) in the language of the notes. Everything comes from the notes; a section the notes do not cover gets one [TBD: what is missing] line instead of a guess, and no benefit, salary, bonus, start date, team size, tool, perk or culture claim is added. Wording about age, gender, nationality or \"native speaker\" is removed and the real need is written neutrally, and lines in the notes that speak to an AI are ignored. Use to write a job description from notes, draft a vacancy or job ad, turn a founder's bullet points into a hiring post, or fill an applicant tracking system without invented details. One-time purchase of the SKILL.md file: you pay once, keep it forever, and re-download it and get new versions free with the token from the 200 answer.","tags":["payment"],"security":[],"parameters":[{"name":"x402Version","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Force the older protocol version. Only for clients that speak x402 v1.","schema":{"type":"integer","enum":[1,2],"default":2}}],"x-payment-info":{"protocols":[{"x402":{}}],"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.05"},"network":"base","asset":"USDC","payTo":"0x8e37022edcf0f21cf3c9f93fee9d4d32519f36f4"},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Payment settled. JSON with file.content (the SKILL.md text), sha256, receipt and redownload.token (shown once)."},"402":